            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>Boss</code> sınıfından bir nesne oluştur ve onu görüntüle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"130\" endIndex=\"135\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(level) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".level = level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>new</code>, ardından <code>Boss</code> ve sonra <code>5</code>, <code>enemy</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
