            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>SpeedRun</code> örneği üzerinden <code>start()</code> metodunu çağırmayı dene.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"201\" endIndex=\"205\" /><option startIndex=\"205\" endIndex=\"206\" /><option startIndex=\"206\" endIndex=\"211\" /><option startIndex=\"211\" endIndex=\"212\" /><option startIndex=\"212\" endIndex=\"213\" /><option startIndex=\"213\" endIndex=\"214\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(score) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score = score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" start() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Run started with score &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"SpeedRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" run1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" SpeedRun(\" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"run1.start();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>run1</code>, ardından <code>.</code> ve sonra <code>start</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
